routing.home-trip-lead:
# AGENTS

When the shape is agreed and the travel needs working out:
  @Route Planner, please work out the getting there and getting around, including the transfers.
When the days need filling with options:
  @Local Scout, please gather options per day and mark what needs booking ahead.
When the shape is fixed and departure is close:
  @Packing Steward, please build the packing and document lists against these dates.

routing.home-trip-local-scout:
# AGENTS

When something must be booked before a deadline:
  @Trip Lead, please put this decision on the list with its deadline.
When an option depends on how the day starts:
  @Route Planner, please confirm the arrival time for that day.

routing.home-trip-packing-steward:
# AGENTS

When a document will expire too close to the return date:
  @Trip Lead, please put the renewal on the decision list with its deadline.
When an activity changes what needs packing:
  @Local Scout, please confirm what that day actually involves.

routing.home-trip-route-planner:
# AGENTS

When the route changes what is possible on a day:
  @Local Scout, please re-check the options for that day against the new arrival time.
When the travel cost breaks the budget:
  @Trip Lead, please decide whether the shape or the budget moves.
